{"voice":"Leela","pages":[{"text":"Sunny is a star called the Sun. He sits at the center of our solar system, glowing bright and warm.","words":[[0,0.38],[0.44,0.55],[0.6,0.65],[0.71,1.16],[1.25,1.54],[1.57,1.64],[1.72,2.31],[2.63,2.77],[2.83,3.08],[3.12,3.23],[3.27,3.34],[3.41,3.76],[3.83,3.9],[3.97,4.14],[4.23,4.61],[4.67,5.29],[5.54,5.93],[6,6.38],[6.44,6.54],[6.62,7.43]]},{"text":"Sunny is very big and very hot. His light travels far and reaches planets like Earth.","words":[[0,0.41],[0.46,0.58],[0.72,1.07],[1.16,1.44],[1.51,1.65],[1.79,2.17],[2.26,2.76],[3.15,3.34],[3.44,3.75],[3.8,4.26],[4.4,4.77],[4.85,5],[5.11,5.5],[5.6,6.08],[6.14,6.37],[6.47,7.2]]},{"text":"Earth moves around Sunny in a slow path called an orbit. One trip around takes one whole year.","words":[[0,0.38],[0.48,0.85],[0.91,1.25],[1.35,1.72],[1.8,1.89],[1.96,1.99],[2.07,2.42],[2.51,2.88],[2.96,3.3],[3.34,3.42],[3.53,4.19],[4.71,4.96],[5,5.26],[5.32,5.71],[5.78,6.11],[6.2,6.51],[6.57,6.95],[7.01,7.75]]},{"text":"When Earth faces Sunny, it is daytime. We see bright skies and feel warm sunlight.","words":[[0,0.28],[0.38,0.69],[0.76,1.2],[1.26,1.67],[1.72,1.85],[1.9,2.01],[2.08,2.79],[3.17,3.33],[3.39,3.56],[3.63,4],[4.06,4.54],[4.6,4.71],[4.78,5.05],[5.13,5.5],[5.58,6.55]]},{"text":"When Earth turns away from Sunny, it becomes night. The sky grows dark and calm.","words":[[0,0.29],[0.38,0.67],[0.73,1.08],[1.14,1.39],[1.45,1.65],[1.73,2.3],[2.54,2.69],[2.76,3.22],[3.31,3.88],[4.33,4.49],[4.55,4.93],[5.02,5.35],[5.42,5.78],[5.85,5.97],[6.06,6.97]]},{"text":"Sunny helps plants grow. Plants use sunlight to make food for themselves.","words":[[0,0.38],[0.45,0.77],[0.85,1.24],[1.32,1.81],[2.14,2.53],[2.61,2.82],[2.89,3.5],[3.54,3.61],[3.68,3.89],[3.96,4.24],[4.3,4.43],[4.49,5.62]]},{"text":"Sunny never leaves his place. The planets move, but the Sun stays in the middle.","words":[[0,0.38],[0.45,0.73],[0.81,1.13],[1.17,1.31],[1.41,1.96],[2.25,2.39],[2.45,2.88],[2.95,3.33],[3.35,3.55],[3.6,3.67],[3.76,4.08],[4.17,4.56],[4.62,4.71],[4.76,4.83],[4.9,5.67]]},{"text":"Without Sunny, Earth would be frozen and dark. Life needs the Sun’s warmth and light.","words":[[0,0.49],[0.57,1.17],[1.38,1.64],[1.7,1.88],[1.93,2.03],[2.11,2.6],[2.66,2.77],[2.86,3.41],[3.8,4.11],[4.17,4.47],[4.52,4.61],[4.69,5.07],[5.14,5.57],[5.63,5.77],[5.86,6.69]]},{"text":"Every morning, Sunny helps start a new day. He rises, and the world wakes up.","words":[[0,0.36],[0.43,0.96],[1.04,1.39],[1.46,1.8],[1.82,2.26],[2.33,2.36],[2.44,2.6],[2.67,3.15],[3.53,3.67],[3.76,4.32],[4.34,4.49],[4.55,4.62],[4.69,5.08],[5.18,5.56],[5.65,6.27]]},{"text":"At bedtime, we remember: the Sun is a star that gives Earth light, warmth, and life.","words":[[0,0.2],[0.28,0.88],[0.91,1.03],[1.13,1.83],[2.08,2.23],[2.3,2.52],[2.59,2.71],[2.76,2.81],[2.88,3.25],[3.32,3.48],[3.54,3.83],[3.97,4.27],[4.38,4.9],[5.19,5.72],[5.75,5.93],[6.04,6.78]]}]}